# Site UI

- Keep route files thin. Page sections live in components.
- Use a client component only for state, events, or a browser-only library.
- Buttons and links need accessible names.
- Use MUI for layout, type, cards, chips, and buttons.
- External links render only after `safeHttpsUrl` accepts them.
